	>
		<p>© {year} AgentViz · License: Code MIT · Content CC BY 4.0</p>
		<a
			href="https://github.com/classkow/agentviz"
			target="_blank"
			rel="noopener"
			class="transition-colors hover:text-zinc-100">GitHub</a
		>
	</div>
</footer>
